ID  - 41865758
TI  - Efficacy and safety of oral semaglutide 14 mg (flexible dose) in early-stage symptomatic Alzheimer's disease (evoke and evoke+): two phase 3, randomised, placebo-controlled trials.
AU  - Cummings Jeffrey L
AU  - Atri Alireza
AU  - Sano Mary
AU  - Zetterberg Henrik
AU  - Scheltens Philip
AU  - Knop Filip K
AU  - Johannsen Peter
