TI  - Impact of ethnicity and antihyperglycemic medications on dementia incidence in older adults with type 2 diabetes.
AU  - Chertok Shacham Elena
AU  - Sharif Sireen
AU  - Kadah Muhammad
AU  - Ayalon Snait
JO  - Endocrine connections
